;message headers
Golem Escort=Golem Escort
StoneGodArrived=Escort Completed Successfully

;objective strings
Objective=Escort the stone god safely to your base and he will reward you by teleporting in reinforcements.
Reinforced=Well done! The stone god has summoned forth an army to assist you. Now you must destroy your enemies' castles.
GolemDestroyed=The stone god has been slain! Although you have failed miserably, you may yet redeem yourself by making another attempt in your next life.
